#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:20
msgid ""
"``colcon`` is a build tool for working with ROS workspaces and packages. "
"This tutorial shows how to create a workspace, add example sources, build "
"and test packages, and source the resulting environment. After you follow "
"these steps, you can run executables from your built workspace."
msgstr ""

