#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:57
msgid "Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:59
