msgid "Try a demo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:320
msgid ""
"With the environment sourced, we can run executables built by colcon. Let's "
"run a subscriber node from the examples:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:323
msgid ""
"$ ros2 run examples_rclcpp_minimal_subscriber subscriber_member_function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:327
msgid ""
"In another terminal, let's run a publisher node (don't forget to source the "
"setup script):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Colcon-Tutorial.rst:329
msgid "$ ros2 run examples_rclcpp_minimal_publisher publisher_member_function"
